  m_text: "The Drift Check activates when exceeding the speed limit while entering
    or in a curve. A skill check bar will pop up in the upper middle screen when
    the mini game is activated.\n\nKeep the red curser inside the green area by accelerating
    or slowing down indicated as up and down arrows. \n\nWinning the Drift Check
    gives points.\nFailing the Drift Check causes damage and shifts the car out of
    the current lane."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
